  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific Specialised Clinical Services &amp; Health Workforce Improvement Program (PSCSHWIP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment consolidates some of Australia&#x2019;s regional funding assistance to strengthen the Pacific&#x2019;s health workforce. Support will be provided through key regional partners, including: the Pacific Community (SPC) Public Health Division (PHD), Royal Australasian College of Surgeons (RACS), and Fiji National University&#x2019;s College of Medicine, Nursing &amp; Health Sciences (FNU-CMNHS). Programs supported under this investment include specialised clinical services and in country education and training.</narrative>
  </description>
